  m_Name: dog miki
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Miki
  descriptionEnglish: "Miki is one of the bravest and most beloved warriors the world
    has ever seen!\nDon\u2019t be fooled by this dog\u2019s angelic face \u2014 he\u2019s
    built to overcome any challenge!\nA tribute to a true warrior, a loyal companion
    and friend of K1."
  nameChinese: Miki
  descriptionChinese: "\u7C73\u5947\u662F\u4E16\u754C\u4E0A\u6700\u52C7\u6562\u3001\u6700\u53D7\u559C\u7231\u7684\u6218\u58EB\u4E4B\u4E00!\n\u522B\u88AB\u8FD9\u53EA\u72D7\u5929\u4F7F\u822C\u7684\u8138\u5E9E\u9A97\u4E86\uFF0C\u4ED6\u53EF\u662F\u80FD\u514B\u670D\u4E00\u5207\u6311\u6218\u7684\u52C7\u58EB!\n\u8FD9\u662F\u5411\u4E00\u4F4D\u771F\u6B63\u7684\u6218\u58EB\u3001K1\u7684\u5FE0\u5B9E\u4F19\u4F34\u548C\u670B\u53CB\u81F4\u656C\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Miki
  descriptionPortuguese: "Miki \xE9 um dos guerreiros mais corajosos e queridos que
    o mundo j\xE1 viu! N\xE3o se engane com a carinha de anjo deste cachorro, pois
    ele \xE9 bom para passar por todos os desafios! Uma homenagem feita a um guerreiro
    de verdade, um companheiro\_e\_amigo\_do\_K1."
  nameSpanish: Miki
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "\xA1Miki es uno de los guerreros m\xE1s valientes y
    queridos que el mundo ha visto!\nNo te dejes enga\xF1ar por la carita de \xE1ngel
    de este perro, \xA1porque est\xE1 listo para superar cualquier desaf\xEDo!\nUn
    homenaje a un verdadero guerrero, un compa\xF1ero fiel y amigo de K1."
  shortName: Miki
